# Furious Forebear, CR 603.10a: a Forebear already in the graveyard triggers once for each creature you control that dies, and one
# dying with them triggers for nothing (ruling: "If Furious Forebear dies at the same time as one or more creatures you control,
# its ability won't trigger"). Bot2 Bolts the first Forebear on turn 2. On turn 4 Bot2's Devilthorn Fox (3/1) attacks, and Bot1
# blocks with the second Forebear and a Memnite: both die at once. Only the first Forebear's ability triggers, twice (`? Stack.Count = 2`):
# Bot1 pays {1}{W} for the first (the Plains and the Mox Jet) and that Forebear returns to its hand; the second still asks
# (it has left the graveyard, so it "won't be returned ... even if you pay") and Bot1 declines. A trigger from the second Forebear
# would be asked here too, and fail the refusal after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Furious Forebear
Memnite
Plains
Plains
Furious Forebear
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Devilthorn Fox
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Furious Forebear.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Furious Forebear)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Furious Forebear
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Devilthorn Fox.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Furious Forebear.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Devilthorn Fox > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Block(Furious Forebear > Devilthorn Fox; Memnite > Devilthorn Fox)
[T4 Bot2.CombatDamage]
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.PayCost
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Decline
! Bot1.Decline
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Furious Forebear; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Furious Forebear; Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Devilthorn Fox; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
